// Deepcopy functions for the preprovisioned provider API types.
//
// This repository carries no controller-gen, so these functions are written by
// hand. Every type carries the matching kubebuilder markers, so controller-gen
// can take this file over later: it overwrites the file, and the generated
// result is equivalent to what is here.
//
// Keep this file in step with the types. A new field needs a new line here.

package v1alpha1

